  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/makeev/alphai-tui/zipball/v0.35.0",
  "body": "## Release Notes\n\n- Ticker news now groups reprints into one row per story by default, like\n  the market feed, with an outlet count such as `×4`. The new **Collapse news**\n  setting controls both feeds; turn it off and Save to see every article.\n  The same choice is available as `[ui] collapse_news` in the config file.\n  Changing the option refreshes the news feed without restarting.\n  Grouped stories also stay together across pages and live updates when\n  their representative article changes. Trending remains grouped.\n\n## Install alphai-tui 0.35.0\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install makeev/tap/alphai-tui\n```\n\n## Download alphai-tui 0.35.0\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [alphai-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [alphai-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [alphai-tui-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [alphai-tui-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [alphai-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/makeev/alphai-tui/releases/download/v0.35.0/alphai-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n"
